caption: HyperGSD plugin library

The ''~HyperGSD plugin library'' lets you install and update the HyperGSD family and associated plugins, entirely within your wiki.

To use in other wikis, drag-and-drop this link into your wiki and import it: [[HyperGSD plugin library|$:/config/HyperGSDPluginLibrary]]